- Switch so Player 2 is X and verify Player 2 moves first.
- Verify normal X win maps to whichever human is X.
- Verify normal O win maps to whichever human is O.
- Verify O_KOMI maps to whichever human is O.
- Verify the switch button is disabled after the first valid move.
- Verify Play Again preserves assignment but re-enables switching.
- Rerun the exhaustive validator and confirm counts remain:
